      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡6=$",
      "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡6 & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(6+\\sqrt{{6}^{2}-1}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(6+\\sqrt{36-1}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(6+\\sqrt{35}).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
