ER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
